                                            {
                                                "example_id": "380bc7f9-2cb7-40a1-ad1b-a87edcbf0b6c",
                                                "sense_id": "b991ff87-f8d5-37cd-b243-fa6cc3ea70d4",
                                                "text": "'We're recruiting an extra signaller for Nunthorpe, the only box [signal box] on the branch', says Chris Gee, Head of Operations - North at Network Rail in York. 'From December Nunthorpe will be staffed 24/7'."
